{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 4, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "In fair Japan, where the cherry blossoms bloom,\nA journey most noble doth I devise,\nA sojourn through time and space, a sight to see,\nIn the land of the rising sun, where the spirits fly free.\n\nFrom Tokyo's heart, our tale doth begin,\nIn the neon lights, where the city's pulse doth spin,\nAscend the heights of the Tokyo Tower,\nTo gaze upon the city, a sight to endower.\n\nThence to Kyoto, with its ancient grace,\nThe temples and gardens, a tranquil space,\nAt Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion gleams,\nA testament to the artistry of the East's schemes.\n\nNext, Nara's deer haunt, where wild and free,\nThe sacred deer roam, under the ancient tree,\nAt Todai-ji, the Buddha's vast form doth rise,\nA sight to behold, in the eyes' sweet surprise.\n\nTo the mountains, to the hot springs' embrace,\nAt Hakone, the spirits of nature we'll trace,\nIn the steamy baths, our weary bones shall rest,\nIn the embrace of nature, our spirits be blessed.\n\nLastly, Osaka, the city of delight,\nA journey's end, but not the night,\nIn the Dotonbori lights, we'll dine and play,\nOur journey's close, but memories will stay.\n\nThus, in Japan, our tale doth conclude,\nA journey through time, a dream to pursue,\nIn the land of the rising sun, where the spirits fly,\nOur hearts are filled with memories, as we say goodbye.", "logprobs": [{"token": "In", "logprob": -3.5782480239868164}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.5388075113296509}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.0815596953034401}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.16309161484241486}, {"token": " where", "logprob": -0.6118385791778564}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.2588257789611816}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.4536723494529724}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.130536749958992}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.04317563772201538}, {"token": " bloom", "logprob": -2.2716684341430664}, {"token": ",", "logpr